item.description:
2016 is back.
&#160;
Throwback outfits and 2010s hits took over Bruin Bash as students turned the clock back a decade. Presented by the Campus Events Commission and Cultural Affairs Commission, the annual festival brought Kid Ink and KYLE to the Los Angeles Tennis Center on Sept.

Fishing is one of the most common themes in modern slots, but the games grouped under that label can behave very differently.
&#160;
Some are conventional reel games with fish symbols and an ocean background.

Key Takeaways

For the fall 2025 quarter, first-year and transfer Asian students made up about 30-45% of UCLA applications, admittances and enrollments from schools in the United States – greater than any other racial or ethnic group for most school types.&#160;
UCLA has seen a rise in overall applicants, with the previous gap between enrolled men and women starting to steadily close as of 2025 admissions as application counts for women plateau and for men rise.
